{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2022-11-16 16:30:00', 'title': "MODERNA TOPS BIOSPACE'S BEST PLACES TO WORK RANKING FOR SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / NOVEMBER 16, 2022 / MODERNA, INC., (NASDAQ:MRNA) A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WAS RANKED THE NUMBER ONE LARGE EMPLOYER IN BIOSPACE\'S 2023 BEST PLACES TO WORK IN BIOPHARMA REPORT. "WE ARE HONORED TO BE RECOGNIZED BY BIOSPACE FOR THE SECOND YEAR IN A ROW AS THE MOST DESIRABLE LARGE EMPLOYER IN THE LIFE SCIENCES INDUSTRY.'}